  "Section 01 / Company background · Case 23, published as “2022” · Financial baseline: 2020": "Bagian 01 / Latar belakang perusahaan · Kasus 23, berjudul “2022” · Tahun dasar keuangan: 2020",
  "Company background": "Latar belakang perusahaan",
  "PT Matahari Putra Prima Tbk (MPPA) is an Indonesian retailer headquartered in Tangerang. It operates Hypermart and a portfolio of supermarket, convenience, health and beauty, and wholesale formats.": "PT Matahari Putra Prima Tbk (MPPA) adalah peritel Indonesia yang berkantor pusat di Tangerang. Perusahaan mengoperasikan Hypermart serta berbagai format supermarket, minimarket, gerai kesehatan dan kecantikan, serta grosir.",
  "Source: case, printed pp. 587 and 590–592. This page describes the business within the case period.": "Sumber: kasus, hlm. cetak 587 dan 590–592. Halaman ini menjelaskan perusahaan dalam periode kasus.",
