  "PESTLE evidence": "Bukti PESTLE",
  "MPPA is the company operating Hypermart and six other formats. It is headquartered in Tangerang. This background describes the business within the case period, rather than its present-day operations.": "MPPA merupakan pengelola Hypermart dan enam format lain, berkantor pusat di Tangerang. Latar belakang ini menggambarkan perusahaan pada periode kasus, bukan operasi saat ini.",
  "Company background · History": "Latar belakang perusahaan · Sejarah",
