  "Competitive Quadrant (Borderline Defensive):": "Kuadran Kompetitif (Perbatasan Defensif):",
  "Sumber Alfaria Trijaya (Alfamart) commands exceptional financial strength (Rp1.06T profit, 5.6 FP) and market dominance (>15,000 stores, -1.4 CP). Positioned to aggressively pursue market penetration, backward supply chain integration, and rapid online and in-store dominance via Alfagift.": "Sumber Alfaria Trijaya (Alfamart) menguasai kekuatan finansial yang sangat kuat (laba Rp1,06 T, FP 5,6) dan dominasi pasar (>15.000 gerai, CP -1,4). Berada di posisi yang tepat untuk secara agresif melakukan penetrasi pasar, integrasi rantai pasok ke hulu, dan dominasi online and in-store kilat via Alfagift.",
  "Transmart (CT Corp) suffers from chronic net losses, crushing long-term mall leases, and severe foot-traffic erosion (-3.6 Y, -1.6 X). Fred David strategy mandates aggressive cost and store cutbacks, closing unviable big-box mall hypermarkets, asset business and asset sales, and core debt restructuring to prevent insolvency.": "Transmart (CT Corp) mengalami kerugian bersih kronis, beban sewa mal jangka panjang yang berat, dan erosi pengunjung mal yang parah (-3,6 Y, -1,6 X). Strategi Fred David mewajibkan penciutan agresif (cost and store cutbacks), penutupan gerai hipermarket mal yang tidak layak, divestasi aset, dan restrukturisasi utang pokok guna mencegah kebangkrutan.",
  "Alfamart occupies an unassailable aggressive posture backed by Rp1.06T net profit, 15,434 proximity stores, and robust Alfagift digital penetration. It can comfortably fund aggressive new store rollouts, warehouse automation, and market penetration while taking market share from struggling big-box hypermarkets.": "Alfamart menempati postur agresif yang tak tertandingi berkat laba bersih Rp1,06 T, 15.434 gerai lingkungan, dan penetrasi digital Alfagift. Alfamart leluasa mendanai pembukaan gerai baru, otomasi gudang, dan penetrasi pasar sambil merebut pangsa pasar dari gerai hipermarket besar yang terpuruk.",
  "Transmart is deep in the Defensive quadrant due to high debt, stranded capital in mall entertainment formats, and plummeting foot traffic. Academic recommendation dictates radical store downsizing, closing dozens of unprofitable mall locations, and drastic overhead rationalization to preserve solvency.": "Transmart berada jauh di dalam kuadran Defensif akibat utang tinggi, modal tertahan pada format hiburan mal, dan anjloknya pengunjung. Rekomendasi akademis mewajibkan perampingan gerai radikal, penutupan puluhan lokasi mal yang merugi, dan rasionalisasi biaya operasional secara drastis untuk menjaga solvabilitas.",

  "Strategy formulation \u00b7 The matching stage (SPACE Matrix)": "Formulasi strategi \u00b7 Tahap pencocokan (Matriks SPACE)",
  "Strategic Position & Action Evaluation (SPACE Matrix)": "Evaluasi Posisi Strategis & Aksi (Matriks SPACE)",
