  "SPACE Matrix": "Matriks SPACE",
  "MPPA \u00b7 COMPETITIVE POSTURE": "MPPA \u00b7 POSTUR KOMPETITIF",
  "Directional Vector: X = +0.60, Y = -2.80 \u00b7 Competitive Quadrant (Borderline Defensive)": "Vektor Arah: X = +0,60, Y = -2,80 \u00b7 Kuadran Kompetitif (Perbatasan Defensif)",
  "AR2020 pp. 54\u201356; Case Exhibit 8; Matahari.xlsx": "AR2020 hlm. 54\u201356; Kasus Lampiran 8; Matahari.xlsx",
  "Strategic Action Rationale:": "Rasional:",
  "Strong food market demand ($30.7B) and rapid online grocery growth (+54%) offset hypermarket store drag. However, negative operating cash flow (-Rp80.4B) and heavy PSAK 73 lease financing charges (Rp166.2B) prohibit expensive debt-financed capex. MPPA must pursue asset-light delivery partnerships (GrabMart), convert space into online order centers, expand compact Hyfresh stores, and selectively retrench losing mall stores.": "Tingginya permintaan pasar pangan ($30,7 miliar) dan lonjakan belanja daring (+54%) mengimbangi beban gerai hipermarket. Namun, arus kas operasional negatif (-Rp80,4 miliar) dan beban sewa PSAK 73 yang besar (Rp166,2 miliar) melarang ekspansi belanja modal berutang mahal. MPPA harus memprioritaskan kemitraan kurir tanpa aset (GrabMart), mengubah ruang gerai menjadi online order center, memperluas gerai kompak Hyfresh, dan menutup selektif gerai mal yang merugi.",
  "Directional Vector Graph (4 Quadrants)": "Grafik Vektor Arah (4 Kuadran)",
