  "Sumber Alfaria Trijaya (Alfamart) holds strong financial liquidity (Rp1.06T profit) and massive convenience proximity (15,434 stores), placing it firmly in the Aggressive quadrant to continue expanding market share.": "Sumber Alfaria Trijaya (Alfamart) memiliki likuiditas keuangan yang kuat (laba Rp1,06 triliun) dan kedekatan minimarket masif (15.434 gerai), menempatkannya kokoh di kuadran Agresif untuk terus memperluas pangsa pasar.",
  "Transmart (CT Corp) suffers from heavy debt and severe foot-traffic collapse in destination malls, placing it deeply in the Defensive quadrant where large-scale store restructuring and closures are necessary.": "Transmart (CT Corp) tertekan utang berat dan penurunan drastis pengunjung mal tujuan, menempatkannya jauh di kuadran Defensif di mana restrukturisasi dan penutupan gerai skala besar sangat diperlukan.",
  "MPPA sits in the Competitive quadrant near the Defensive border. Solid fresh produce reputation and $30.7B grocery demand provide upside, but -Rp80.4B operating cash flow and PSAK 73 leases demand low-capital digital partnerships and selective store retrenchment.": "MPPA berada di kuadran Kompetitif dekat perbatasan Defensif. Reputasi produk segar yang solid dan permintaan pasar sembako $30,7 miliar memberi peluang, namun arus kas operasi -Rp80,4 miliar dan sewa PSAK 73 menuntut kemitraan digital rendah modal serta penutupan selektif toko yang merugi.",
