  "Scale: -1 (best) to -7 (worst) \u00b7 External": "Skala: -1 (terbaik) s/d -7 (terburuk) \u00b7 Eksternal",
  "Market share (-5.0) \u00b7 Fresh quality (-2.0) \u00b7 Loyalty (-4.0) \u00b7 Variety (-2.0) \u00b7 Suppliers (-3.0)": "Pangsa pasar (-5,0) \u00b7 Mutu segar (-2,0) \u00b7 Loyalitas (-4,0) \u00b7 Variasi (-2,0) \u00b7 Pemasok (-3,0)",
  "Market share (2.7% = -5), Fresh food quality (Halal cold chain = -2), Customer loyalty (3.5M Hicard = -4), Product variety (30,000 SKUs = -2), Supplier control (750 vendors = -3). Fresh food strengths offset by low market share.": "Pangsa pasar (2,7% = -5), Mutu makanan segar (rantai pendingin Halal = -2), Loyalitas pelanggan (3,5 juta Hicard = -4), Variasi produk (30.000 SKU = -2), Kendali pemasok (750 vendor = -3). Keunggulan produk segar tertahan pangsa pasar rendah.",
  "Growth potential (5.0) \u00b7 Stability (4.0) \u00b7 Entry barriers (4.0) \u00b7 Space use (3.0) \u00b7 Profit margins (3.0)": "Potensi tumbuh (5,0) \u00b7 Stabilitas (4,0) \u00b7 Hambatan masuk (4,0) \u00b7 Pemanfaatan ruang (3,0) \u00b7 Margin laba (3,0)",
  "Growth potential ($30.7B market, e-grocery +54% = 5), Financial stability (essential food = 4), Entry barriers (cold chain = 4), Resource utilization (hypermarket space = 3), Profit potential (tight margins = 3). Large essential staple food market.": "Potensi pertumbuhan (pasar $30,7 miliar, e-grocery +54% = 5), Stabilitas finansial (sembako pokok = 4), Hambatan masuk (rantai pendingin = 4), Pemanfaatan ruang (lantai hipermarket = 3), Potensi laba (margin tipis = 3). Pasar pangan pokok yang sangat masif.",
  "Spending drop (-4.0) \u00b7 Tech shift (-5.0) \u00b7 Price elasticity (-4.0) \u00b7 Minimarket rivalry (-6.0) \u00b7 PSAK 73 (-4.0)": "Penurunan belanja (-4,0) \u00b7 Pergeseran teknologi (-5,0) \u00b7 Elastisitas harga (-4,0) \u00b7 Persaingan minimarket (-6,0) \u00b7 PSAK 73 (-4,0)",
  "Household spending (-2.63% contraction = -4), Tech shift (on-demand apps = -5), Price elasticity (zero switching cost = -4), Competitive pressure (33,500 minimarkets = -6), PSAK 73 lease regulations (-4). Hostile external environment.": "Belanja rumah tangga (kontraksi -2,63% = -4), Disrupsi teknologi (aplikasi kurir = -5), Elastisitas harga (biaya peralihan nol = -4), Tekanan persaingan (33.500 minimarket = -6), Regulasi sewa PSAK 73 (-4). Lingkungan eksternal sangat menantang.",
  "Vector Calculation": "Perhitungan Vektor",
  "Strategic Posture & Diagnosis": "Postur Strategis & Diagnosis",
  "Strategic Posture & Academic Diagnosis": "Postur Strategis & Diagnosis",
  "Competitive Quadrant (Borderline Defensive):": "Kuadran Kompetitif (Perbatasan Defensif):",
  "MPPA has viable product advantages in an expanding essential grocery market, but lacks the balance sheet strength to fund heavy capital investments. Recovery must prioritize low-capital digital partnerships (GrabMart), dark-store repurposing, and closing unprofitable mall stores.": "MPPA memiliki keunggulan produk yang layak di pasar sembako yang bertumbuh, namun kekurangan kekuatan neraca untuk mendanai investasi modal besar. Pemulihan harus memprioritaskan kemitraan digital rendah modal (GrabMart), pemanfaatan gerai sebagai online order center, dan penutupan toko mal yang merugi.",
  "Sources: Fred David Strategic Management Ch. 6; Case 23; Audited AR2020; Matahari.xlsx Sheet 'SPACE'": "Sumber: Fred David Strategic Management Bab 6; Kasus 23; AR2020 Teraudit; Matahari.xlsx Sheet 'SPACE'",
  "Slide 25 synthesizes the internal and external strategic dimensions into the Strategic Position and Action Evaluation (SPACE) Matrix, plotting MPPA across Financial Position (FP: +1.80), Competitive Position (CP: -3.20), Industry Position (IP: +3.80), and Stability Position (SP: -4.60). The resulting directional vector of X = +0.60 and Y = -2.80 places MPPA in the Competitive Quadrant, directly on the frontier of the Defensive posture. This mathematical diagnosis confirms that while high structural food demand and online and in-store grocery expansion provide viable commercial runway, chronic net losses and PSAK 73 lease liabilities strictly preclude balance-sheet-heavy expansions, mandating asset-light partnerships with Grab and selective store retrenchment. Benchmarking against rivals illustrates Alfamart firmly in the Aggressive Quadrant (X: +3.80, Y: +3.00) powered by minimarket ubiquity, while Transmart languishes in the Defensive Quadrant (X: -1.60, Y: -3.60) from mall hypermarket anchor exposure.": "Slide 25 mensintesis dimensi strategis internal dan eksternal ke dalam Matriks Evaluasi Posisi Strategis dan Aksi (SPACE Matrix), memetakan MPPA pada Posisi Keuangan (FP: +1,80), Posisi Kompetitif (CP: -3,20), Posisi Industri (IP: +3,80), dan Posisi Stabilitas (SP: -4,60). Vektor arah yang dihasilkan X = +0,60 dan Y = -2,80 menempatkan MPPA di Kuadran Kompetitif, tepat di perbatasan postur Defensif. Diagnosis matematis ini menegaskan bahwa meskipun permintaan pangan struktural dan ekspansi sembako online and in-store memberikan ruang pertumbuhan yang layak, kerugian bersih berkepanjangan dan liabilitas sewa PSAK 73 melarang keras ekspansi padat modal, sehingga mewajibkan kemitraan tanpa aset berat (asset-light) bersama Grab dan penutupan selektif gerai mal yang merugi. Pembandingan terhadap pesaing menggambarkan Alfamart berada kokoh di Kuadran Agresif (X: +3,80, Y: +3,00) berkat kedekatan minimarket, sementara Transmart tertekan di Kuadran Defensif (X: -1,60, Y: -3,60) akibat beban gerai mal besar.",

  /* SPACE Matrix Notes Translations */
  "Strategy formulation \u00b7 Matching stage (Stage 2)": "Formulasi strategi \u00b7 Tahap pencocokan (Tahap 2)",
  "Fred David Ch. 6 framework \u00b7 Sourced from Matahari.xlsx sheet 'SPACE' \u00b7 Baseline 2020": "Kerangka Fred David Bab 6 \u00b7 Bersumber dari Matahari.xlsx lembar 'SPACE' \u00b7 Tahun Dasar 2020",
  "The SPACE Matrix evaluates MPPA across two internal dimensions\u2014Financial Position (FP: +1.80) and Competitive Position (CP: -3.20)\u2014and two external dimensions\u2014Industry Position (IP: +3.80) and Stability Position (SP: -4.60).": "Matriks SPACE mengevaluasi MPPA melalui dua dimensi internal\u2014Posisi Keuangan (FP: +1,80) dan Posisi Kompetitif (CP: -3,20)\u2014serta dua dimensi eksternal\u2014Posisi Industri (IP: +3,80) dan Posisi Stabilitas (SP: -4,60).",
  "Directional Vector Coordinates": "Koordinat Vektor Arah",
  "This directional vector locates MPPA in the Competitive Quadrant, directly along the frontier of the Defensive quadrant.": "Vektor arah ini menempatkan MPPA di Kuadran Kompetitif, tepat di sepanjang perbatasan kuadran Defensif.",
  "Strategic implication: MPPA possesses viable market demand and product advantages in fresh food, but its severe financial weakness strictly precludes debt-heavy capital expenditures. Recovery mandates asset-light digital partnerships (GrabMart), repurposing excess store space into online order centers, and aggressive cost and store cutbacks of unprofitable mall hypermarkets.": "Implikasi strategis: MPPA memiliki permintaan pasar yang kuat dan keunggulan produk pangan segar yang layak, namun kelemahan keuangan yang parah melarang keras belanja modal padat utang. Pemulihan mewajibkan kemitraan digital tanpa aset berat (GrabMart), pengalihan ruang toko berlebih menjadi online order center, dan penciutan agresif gerai mal yang merugi.",
