  "Scale standalone neighborhood fresh supermarkets in dense residential areas. Unify small formats under the powerful 'Hy-' master brand (Hypermart, Hyfresh, Hy-Express).": "Ekspansi supermarket segar pemukiman mandiri di area perumahan padat. Satukan format gerai kecil di bawah merek master 'Hy-' (Hypermart, Hyfresh, Hy-Express).",
  "Downsize 30+ oversized 5,000–8,000 m² hypermarkets. Sublease 40–50% released space to essential service tenants and convert backrooms into temperature-controlled dark micro-fulfillment hubs.": "Perkecil skala 30+ hipermarket 5.000–8.000 m². Sewakan 40–50% area kosong ke penyewa layanan esensial dan ubah gudang belakang menjadi hub pemenuhan mikro gelap bersuhu dingin.",
  "Transition anchor leases from fixed guarantees to turnover-linked rent (12–15%) to cut Rp166.2B lease charges. Orderly liquidate negative-EBITDA SmartClub and FMX to unlock trapped cash.": "Alihkan sewa jangkar dari jaminan tetap ke sewa berbasis omzet (12–15%) untuk memangkas beban sewa Rp166,2M. Likuidasi tertib unit SmartClub dan FMX yang merugi guna mencairkan kas.",
