  "Financial Prudence Moat:": "Benteng Kehati-hatian Keuangan:",
  "By matching CapEx to internal cash generation and divestment proceeds, MPPA avoids additional external bank debt, preserving liquidity covenants (Interest Coverage > 2.0x, Debt/Equity < 2.5x).": "Dengan mencocokkan CapEx terhadap kas internal dan hasil divestasi, MPPA menghindari utang bank eksternal tambahan, menjaga syarat pinjaman likuiditas (Interest Coverage > 2,0x, Debt/Equity < 2,5x).",
  "Sources: Fred David Strategic Management Ch. 5 & 6; Sample PPT Slide 30; Case 23 pp. 587–596 · Audited AR2020": "Sumber: Manajemen Strategis Fred David Bab 5 & 6; Slide 30 PPT Sampel; Kasus 23 hlm. 588–596 · AR2020 Teraudit",
  "Slide 29 delivers the core actionable corporate recommendation for PT Matahari Putra Prima Tbk (MPPA), synthesizing the quantitative evaluation from the QSPM (Slide 27) and the matched strategic alternatives (Slide 28). The turnaround plan executes the quantitative findings from QSPM: Strategy 1 (TAS 6.620) scales compact fresh neighborhood supermarkets (Hyfresh) under a unified 'Hy-' master brand, deploying 75–100 new stores to capture resilient food demand; Strategy 2 (TAS 5.460) reduces store size at oversized hypermarkets from 6,000 m² to ~3,000 m² and establishes temperature-controlled dark micro-fulfillment hubs for GrabMart, Shopee, Tokopedia, and Hypermart Online to reach 10%+ online GMV; while Strategy 3 rebalances the balance sheet by transitioning PSAK 73 mall leases to turnover-linked variable rent and liquidating subscale SmartClub and FMX assets. Crucially, the Rp450 billion 5-year CapEx plan is 100% self-funded through Rp120B in divestment proceeds, Rp180B in lease savings, and operational cash flows, completely avoiding new bank debt and protecting BNI credit covenants.": "Slide 29 menyajikan rekomendasi korporat konkret untuk PT Matahari Putra Prima Tbk (MPPA), menyintesis evaluasi kuantitatif dari QSPM (Slide 27) dan alternatif strategis hasil pencocokan (Slide 28). Rencana pemulihan ini bertumpu pada tiga strategi yang selaras: (1) Ekspansi supermarket segar pemukiman kompak (Hyfresh) di bawah merek master 'Hy-', membuka 75–100 gerai baru guna menangkap permintaan pangan pokok; (2) Perampingan hipermarket besar dari 6.000 m² menjadi ~3.000 m² serta penyediaan hub pemenuhan mikro gelap bersuhu dingin untuk GrabMart, Shopee, Tokopedia, dan Hypermart Online guna meraih 10%+ GMV digital; serta (3) Penyehatan neraca dengan mengalihkan kontrak sewa mal PSAK 73 ke sewa variabel berbasis omzet dan melikuidasi aset subskala SmartClub dan FMX. Yang terpenting, rencana belanja modal 5 tahun senilai Rp450 miliar didanai 100% secara mandiri melalui Rp120M hasil divestasi, Rp180M penghematan sewa, dan arus kas operasional, tanpa memerlukan utang bank baru serta melindungi syarat pinjaman kredit BNI.",

