  "Method 3 \u2261 Method 4 Redundancy": "Redundansi Metode 3 \u2261 Metode 4",
  "(Share Price / EPS) \u00d7 Net Income simplifies algebraically to Price \u00d7 Shares. Averaging all four methods double-counts market capitalization (50% weight), heavily biasing valuation toward volatile equity sentiment.": "(Harga Saham / EPS) \u00d7 Laba Bersih secara aljabar disederhanakan menjadi Harga \u00d7 Saham. Merata-ratakan keempat metode menggandakan bobot kapitalisasi pasar (bobot 50%), sangat membiaskan valuasi ke sentimen ekuitas pasar.",
  "Averaging Negative Restructuring Losses": "Distorsi Perata-rataan Kerugian Restrukturisasi",
  "Mixing positive tangible net worth (+Rp 182.4B) with a negative 5-year multiple (-Rp 2.03T) produces an artificial negative valuation (-Rp 77.1B). A going concern generating Rp 6.75T in annual cash sales cannot have negative value.": "Mencampur kekayaan bersih berwujud positif (+Rp 182,4M) dengan kelipatan 5 tahun negatif (-Rp 2,03T) menghasilkan valuasi negatif semu (-Rp 77,1M). Usaha berjalan yang menghasilkan penjualan kas tahunan Rp 6,75T tidak dapat memiliki nilai negatif.",
  "Distressed Penny Stock vs. Real Logistics Moat": "Diskon Saham Murah vs. Parit Logistik Riil",
  "At Rp 102/share, MPPA's Rp 768.0B market cap reflects bankruptcy fear, completely ignoring Rp 789.9B in net PP&E and 66,755 m\u00b2 of multi-temperature Halal cold chain distribution centers across Java and Sumatra.": "Pada harga Rp 102/saham, kapitalisasi pasar MPPA Rp 768,0M mencerminkan ketakutan kebangkrutan, sepenuhnya mengabaikan Rp 789,9M aset tetap bersih dan 66.755 m\u00b2 pusat distribusi rantai dingin Halal multi-suhu di Jawa dan Sumatra.",
  "Normalized Post-Turnaround Target (2023P)": "Target Valuasi Normalisasi Pasca-Pemulihan (2023P)",
  "Upon executing the 50-store Hyfresh rollout, MPPA achieves +Rp 870.0B Net Income. At 5x earnings = Rp 4.35T. Applying a 15x peer retail P/E yields an intrinsic target of Rp 13.05T (Rp 1,733/share), unlocking 17.0x shareholder value.": "Setelah mengeksekusi ekspansi 50 gerai Hyfresh, MPPA mencapai Laba Bersih +Rp 870,0M. Pada 5x laba = Rp 4,35T. Menerapkan P/E pembanding ritel 15x menghasilkan target nilai intrinsik Rp 13,05T (Rp 1.733/saham), membuka potensi kenaikan 17,0x nilai pemegang saham.",
  "Fred David 4-method average is severely distorted by restructuring losses. Real enterprise value is unlocked via normalized post-turnaround cash flow (+Rp 870B PAT by 2023).": "Rata-rata 4 metode Fred David sangat terdistorsi oleh kerugian restrukturisasi. Nilai perusahaan riil dibuka melalui normalisasi arus kas operasi (+Rp 870M laba bersih pada 2023).",
