  "Consolidates accepted generic strategies: (1) Unify small formats under the 'Hy-' Master Brand (Hyfresh neighborhood stores, transit Hy-Express pilot, Primo luxury halo); (2) Make Smaller Hypermarts by 30\u201340% and deploy GrabMart hybrid O2O online order centers; (3) Cost And Store Cutbacks: terminate loss-making mall kiosks and liquidate SmartClub wholesale.": "Mengonsolidasikan strategi generik terpilih: (1) Menyatukan format kecil di bawah Master Brand 'Hy-' (gerai perumahan Hyfresh, pilot transit Hy-Express, halo kemewahan Primo); (2) Merampingkan gerai Hypermart sebesar 30\u201340% dan menerapkan pusat pesanan daring hibrida O2O GrabMart; (3) Cost And Store Cutbacks: menghentikan kios mal yang merugi dan melikuidasi grosir SmartClub.",
