  "During COVID-19 mobility curbs, consumers did not stop eating or reduce staple food intake; household grocery budgets remained active and non-negotiable throughout 2020.": "Selama pembatasan mobilitas COVID-19, konsumen tidak berhenti makan atau mengurangi asupan makanan pokok; anggaran belanja dapur rumah tangga tetap aktif dan tak terelakkan sepanjang 2020.",
