  "The EFE matrix assesses MPPA’s response to external economic, social, competitive, and regulatory opportunities and threats. Total score is 2.46 (against industry benchmark 2.50), reflecting strong online and in-store agility offset by hypermarket mall vulnerability.": "Matriks EFE menilai daya tanggap MPPA terhadap peluang dan ancaman ekonomi, sosial, kompetitif, dan regulasi. Total skor adalah 2,46 (berbanding tolok ukur rata-rata industri 2,50), mencerminkan kelincahan online and in-store yang kuat namun diimbangi oleh kerentanan format hipermarket di mall.",
