  "The BCG Matrix analyzes MPPA's multi-divisional business portfolio across two quantitative dimensions: Relative Market Share Position (RMSP) on the horizontal axis (scale 1.0 to 0.0 with 0.50 midpoint) and Industry Sales Growth Rate (IGR) on the vertical axis (scale -20% to +20% with 0.0% midpoint). Circle sizes represent divisional shares of total retail format sales (Case 23 Exhibit 6).": "Matriks BCG menganalisis portofolio bisnis multidivisi MPPA melalui dua dimensi kuantitatif: Posisi Pangsa Pasar Relatif (RMSP) pada sumbu horizontal (skala 1,0 hingga 0,0 dengan titik tengah 0,50) dan Tingkat Pertumbuhan Penjualan Industri (IGR) pada sumbu vertikal (skala -20% hingga +20% dengan titik tengah 0,0%). Ukuran lingkaran mencerminkan pangsa divisi terhadap total penjualan format ritel (Kasus 23 Lampiran 6).",
  "Divisional Classification & Strategic Diagnosis": "Klasifikasi Divisi & Diagnosis Strategis",
  "1. Hypermart (Dog / Declining Cow):": "1. Hypermart (Dog / Declining Cow):",
  "Rp5,698B (84.5% sales), RMSP 0.41 vs Transmart (Rp13,857B), IGR -12.0%. Massive 5,000–8,000 m² hypermarket spaces suffer secular traffic contraction. Strategy: Harvesting cash flow and downsizing sales floors into compact 2,500 m² layouts while subleasing excess area to GrabMart dark stores.": "Rp5.698M (84,5% penjualan), RMSP 0,41 terhadap Transmart (Rp13.857M), IGR -12,0%. Area luas hipermarket 5.000–8.000 m² mengalami penurunan trafik jangka panjang. Strategi: Memanen arus kas dan merampingkan luas lantai menjadi 2.500 m² serta menyewakan ruang sisa untuk online order center GrabMart.",
  "2. Foodmart & Primo (Dog):": "2. Foodmart & Primo (Dog):",
  "Rp689B (10.2% sales), RMSP 0.07 vs Super Indo (Rp9,500B), IGR -2.0%. Premium supermarket format in enclosed malls. Strategy: Selective harvesting and SKU rationalization focused on high-margin gourmet perishables without aggressive capex.": "Rp689M (10,2% penjualan), RMSP 0,07 terhadap Super Indo (Rp9.500M), IGR -2,0%. Format supermarket premium di dalam mal. Strategi: Pemanenan selektif dan rasionalisasi SKU berfokus pada pangan segar gourmet bermargin tinggi tanpa belanja modal agresif.",
  "3. Hyfresh (Question Mark):": "3. Hyfresh (Question Mark):",
  "Rp135B (2.0% sales), RMSP 0.01 vs Alfamidi (Rp12,535B), IGR +10.0%. Compact neighborhood grocery format; net +1 store expansion in 2020. Strategy: Intensive Market Penetration—redeploying harvested capital to expand standalone residential stores powered by MPPA's 66,755 m² central cold chain.": "Rp135M (2,0% penjualan), RMSP 0,01 terhadap Alfamidi (Rp12.535M), IGR +10,0%. Format supermarket lingkungan kompak; ekspansi bersih +1 gerai di 2020. Strategi: Penetrasi Pasar Intensif—mengalihkan modal yang dipanen untuk memperluas gerai hunian mandiri bermodal rantai dingin 66.755 m² MPPA.",
  "4. Boston Health & Beauty (Question Mark):": "4. Boston Health & Beauty (Question Mark):",
  "Rp45B (0.7% sales), RMSP 0.09 vs Guardian/Watsons (Rp1,800B), IGR +14.0%. Personal care and pharmacy boom. Strategy: Product development and online and in-store integration (shop-in-shop inside Hyfresh, instant 30-minute delivery via GrabMart).": "Rp45M (0,7% penjualan), RMSP 0,09 terhadap Guardian/Watsons (Rp1.800M), IGR +14,0%. Lonjakan produk perawatan pribadi dan apotek. Strategi: Pengembangan produk dan integrasi online and in-store (shop-in-shop di dalam Hyfresh, pengantaran kilat 30 menit via GrabMart).",
  "5. SmartClub Wholesale (Dog):": "5. SmartClub Wholesale (Dog):",
  "Rp134B (2.0% sales), RMSP 0.01 vs Lotte Wholesale (Rp7,800B), IGR -15.0%. Candidate for Sale Of A Business Or Assets or Liquidation to stop ongoing working-capital drain.": "Rp134M (2,0% penjualan), RMSP 0,01 terhadap Lotte Wholesale (Rp7.800M), IGR -15,0%. Kandidat Divestasi atau Likuidasi untuk menghentikan pengurasan modal kerja yang terus berlanjut.",
  "Strategic Synthesis: 96.7% of MPPA's revenue is concentrated in contracting Dog formats (Hypermart, Foodmart, SmartClub) with 0% in Stars or Cash Cows. Fred David strategy prescribes harvesting cash from hypermarkets and liquidating unviable assets to aggressively scale high-growth Question Marks (Hyfresh, Boston) into future Stars.": "Sintesis Strategis: 96,7% pendapatan MPPA terkonsentrasi pada format Dogs yang menurun (Hypermart, Foodmart, SmartClub) dengan 0% di Stars maupun Cash Cows. Strategi Fred David memandatkan pemanenan kas dari hipermarket dan likuidasi aset yang tidak menguntungkan guna memperbesar format Question Marks yang bertumbuh tinggi (Hyfresh, Boston) menjadi Stars di masa depan.",

