  "“To become the premier, multi-format, go-to shopping destination throughout Indonesia.”": "“Menjadi destinasi belanja utama, multi-format, dan menjadi pilihan di seluruh Indonesia.”",
  "Provisional phrasing proposed by textbook case authors (printed p. 587) prior to matrix formulation.": "Rumusan sementara yang diusulkan penulis buku teks (hlm. cetak 587) sebelum perumusan matriks strategis.",
  "FRED DAVID (2023) CH. 2 AUDIT": "AUDIT FRED DAVID (2023) BAB 2",
  "Why This Suggestion Fails the Strategic Test": "Mengapa Usulan Ini Gagal Memenuhi Kriteria Strategis",
  "1. Fails 5-Characteristic Vision Test:": "1. Gagal Tes 5 Karakteristik Visi:",
  "Lacks a 5-year target horizon (not futuristic); gives no clue how MPPA will win (not unique); uses generic retail buzzwords ('premier shopping destination').": "Tidak memiliki target batas 5 tahun (tidak futuristik); tidak menjelaskan keunggulan unik MPPA (tidak unik); memakai jargon ritel umum ('destinasi belanja utama').",
  "2. Missing 8 of 9 Mission Components:": "2. Kehilangan 8 dari 9 Komponen Misi:",
  "Omits Customers, Products, Technology, Survival/Profitability, Philosophy, Distinctive Competence, Public Image, and Employees.": "Mengabaikan Pelanggan, Produk, Teknologi, Profitabilitas/Kelangsungan, Filosofi, Keunggulan Khas, Citra Publik, dan Karyawan.",
  "3. Fatal Disconnect from Company Crisis:": "3. Keterputusan Fatal dari Krisis Perusahaan:",
  "Ignores MPPA’s 4-year Rp 3.53T losses, oversized hypermarket lease drag, negative operating cash flows, and urgent need for food-waste control.": "Mengabaikan rugi 4 tahun MPPA sebesar Rp 3,53T, beban sewa hipermarket raksasa, arus kas operasi negatif, dan kebutuhan mendesak pengendalian susut pangan.",
  "4. Lack of Operational Guidance:": "4. Tidak Memiliki Arahan Operasional:",
  "Provides zero actionable direction for format downsizing, Halal cold-chain logistics, or digital O2O online order center micro-fulfillment.": "Tidak memberikan arahan konkret bagi perampingan format, logistik rantai dingin Halal, maupun pemenuhan pusat pesanan daring (online order center) O2O digital.",
  "Fred David Chapter 2 Mandate:": "Mandat Fred David Bab 2:",
  "An effective corporate strategy cannot be executed on vague platitudes. A fully compliant 2021–2025 Vision & Mission audited against all 9 components is formulated in Stage 4 (Slide 31) to anchor the Hyfresh neighborhood fresh expansion and self-funded turnaround.": "Strategi korporat efektif tidak dapat dijalankan dengan slogan samar. Visi & Misi 2021–2025 yang patuh penuh dan diaudit terhadap 9 komponen dirumuskan pada Tahap 4 (Slide 31) untuk mengunci ekspansi supermarket segar Hyfresh dan pembiayaan mandiri.",
  "Source: case, printed p. 587 · Fred R. David, Strategic Management 17th/18th Ed., Ch. 2": "Sumber: kasus, hlm. cetak 587 · Fred R. David, Strategic Management Edisi 17/18, Bab 2",

