  "MPPA's corporate cash generation relies almost entirely (84.2%) on Hypermart (RMSP 0.41, IGR -12.0%), which is trapped in the Dog quadrant alongside Foodmart (10.5%) and SmartClub (2.0%). Growth opportunities (Hyfresh +10%, Boston +14%) represent only 4.7% of sales, demanding immediate capital reallocation from downsizing large stores to fund compact formats.": "Hypermart menghasilkan 84,2% penjualan MPPA (pangsa pasar relatif 0,41, pertumbuhan industri −12,0%) dan berada di kuadran Dog bersama Foodmart (10,5%) dan SmartClub (2,0%). Hyfresh (+10%) dan Boston (+14%) hanya menyumbang 4,7% penjualan. Tim mengusulkan pengalihan modal dari pengurangan luas gerai besar untuk mendanai format yang lebih kecil.",
  "Industry Sales Growth Rate (IGR) · High +20% ← 0.0% → -20% Low": "Pertumbuhan penjualan industri (IGR) · Tinggi +20% ← 0,0% → −20% Rendah",
