  ". MPPA must execute the": ". Tim mengusulkan",
  "Brand Architecture:": "Arsitektur merek",
  "Rebrand and unify fragmented storefronts (Foodmart, Primo, viable express kiosks) under the single": "Satukan merek gerai yang terpisah (Foodmart, Primo, dan kios ekspres yang layak) di bawah",
  "\"Hy-\" Master Brand Family (Hypermart & Hyfresh)": "merek induk Hy- (Hypermart dan Hyfresh)",
  "Format Distinctiveness:": "Ciri khas format",
  "Distinctively establish": "Kembangkan",
  "as a dedicated 500–1,000 m² neighborhood fresh supermarket (60%+ fresh mix) distinct from big boxes and minimarkets; (3)": "sebagai supermarket lingkungan seluas 500–1.000 m² dengan porsi produk segar minimal 60% yang berbeda dari hipermarket dan minimarket. (3)",
  "Keep customer storefronts active to capture foot-traffic margins while embedding MPPA hybrid O2O micro-fulfillment storefronts; and (4)": "Pertahankan gerai untuk melayani pengunjung sambil menyediakan ruang untuk menyiapkan pesanan daring. (4)",
  "Selective Divestment:": "Divestasi selektif",
  "Liquidate subscale non-core assets (SmartClub B2B wholesale and unviable standalone convenience leases) to fund compact store expansion.": "Likuidasi aset noninti yang terlalu kecil, termasuk grosir B2B SmartClub dan sewa gerai yang tidak layak, untuk mendanai ekspansi gerai kecil.",
  "Sources: Fred David Strategic Management Ch. 6; Case 23 pp. 588–596; Audited AR2020; Matahari.xlsx Sheet 'IE'": "Sumber · Fred David, Strategic Management Bab 6 · Kasus 23 hlm. 588–596 · Laporan Tahunan 2020 yang diaudit · Lembar IE pada Matahari.xlsx",
  "Slide 26: Grand Strategy Matrix (GSM)": "Slide 26 · Matriks Strategi Besar (GSM)",
  "GSM Matrix": "Matriks GSM",
  "Case 23 pp. 588–596; Matahari.xlsx Sheet 'GRAND'": "Kasus 23 hlm. 588–596 · Lembar GRAND pada Matahari.xlsx",
  "Consolidated MPPA (X: 3.8, Y: 3.5) sits in Quadrant III due to overwhelming revenue concentration (84.5%) in contracting large-format hypermarkets (-12.0% CAGR). Under Fred R. David's GSM framework, Quadrant III organizations must execute": "MPPA secara konsolidasi (X 3,8, Y 3,5) berada di Kuadran III karena 84,5% pendapatan berasal dari hipermarket berformat besar yang menyusut (CAGR −12,0%). Menurut kerangka GSM Fred R. David, opsi strategi Kuadran III meliputi",
  "Cost And Store Cutbacks (downsizing large boxes)": "Penciutan (pengurangan luas gerai besar)",
  "Sale Of A Business Or Assets (liquidating unviable B2B wholesale)": "Divestasi (likuidasi grosir B2B yang tidak layak)",
  "while reallocating capital into Quadrant II high-growth compact formats (Hyfresh at X: 4.0, Y: 7.5).": "sambil mengalihkan modal ke format kecil yang bertumbuh di Kuadran II (Hyfresh, X 4,0 dan Y 7,5).",
  "MPPA Corporate": "MPPA Korporat",
  "COMPETITIVE POSITION (X)": "POSISI KOMPETITIF (X)",
  "Large Format Hypermarket": "Hipermarket berformat besar",
  "Supermarket Banner": "Merek supermarket",
  "Compact Fresh Supermarket": "Supermarket produk segar berformat kecil",
  "Market Penetration:": "Penetrasi pasar",
  "Pharmacy & Personal Care": "Apotek dan perawatan pribadi",
